=>'Rán imeeli sí àwọn Olùtajà tó yan nígbà tí a bá fi %s silẹ','Email designated Publishers when a %s is published'=>'Rán imeeli sí àwọn Olùtajà tó yan nígbà tí a bá tẹ %s jáde','Email designated Publishers when a %s is approved'=>'Rán imeeli sí àwọn Olùtajà tó yan nígbà tí a bá fọwọ́si %s','Email Editors and Administrators when a %s is submitted'=>'Rán imeeli sí àwọn Ẹlẹ́da àti Alákóso nígbà tí a bá fi %s silẹ','Email Editors and Administrators when a %s is published'=>'Rán imeeli sí àwọn Ẹlẹ́da àti Alákóso nígbà tí a bá tẹ %s jáde','Email Editors and Administrators when a %s is approved'=>'Rán imeeli sí àwọn Ẹlẹ́da àti Alákóso nígbà tí a bá fọwọ́si %s','PublishPress Revisions Site Settings'=>'Àwọn Eto Àtúnṣe PublishPress','These are the default settings for options which can be adjusted per-site.'=>'Eyi ni awọn eto aiyipada fun awọn aṣayan ti a le ṣatunṣe fun oju-iwe kọọkan.','Use this tab to make NETWORK-WIDE changes to PublishPress Revisions settings. %s'=>'Lo taabu yii lati ṣe awọn ayipada ni gbogbo NETWORK si awọn eto PublishPress Revisions. %s','You can also specify %1$sdefaults for site-specific settings%2$s.'=>'O tun le sọ %1$s awọn aiyipada fun awọn eto pato si oju-iwe %2$s.','Here you can change the default value for settings which are controlled separately on each site.'=>'Nibi o le yi iye aiyipada pada fun awọn eto ti a n ṣakoso ni ọna lọtọ ni oju-iwe kọọkan.','Note that %1$s network-wide settings%2$s may also be available.'=>'Akíyèsí pé %1$s awọn eto ni gbogbo nẹtiwọọki %2$s le tun wa.','License'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','Past Revisions are earlier versions of a post.'=>'Awọn Atunṣe Ti kọja jẹ awọn ẹya iṣaaju ti ifiweranṣẹ kan.','This post type does not support Past Revisions.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ yii ko ni atilẹyin awọn Atunṣe Ti kọja.','New Revisions are changes which are not yet published.'=>'Awọn Atunṣe Tuntun jẹ awọn ayipada ti ko ti gbejade sibẹsibẹ.','Note: Third party code may cause some post types to be incompatible with PublishPress Revisions.'=>'Akíyèsí: Koodu ẹgbẹ kẹta le fa ki awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ kan ma ba PublishPress Revisions mu.','For Revisions integration on the Content Calendar, Overview and Content Board, please update %sPublishPress Planner Pro%s.'=>'Fun iṣọpọ Atunṣe lori Kalendaru Awọn akoonu, Akopọ ati Igbimọ Akọkọ, jọwọ ṣe imudojuiwọn %sPublishPress Planner Pro%s.','Ready to enhance your revision workflow?'=>'Ṣe o setan lati mu ilọsiwaju iṣẹ atunṣe rẹ?','Get PublishPress Statuses Pro and optimize your revision process with custom revision statuses.'=>'Gba PublishPress Statuses Pro ki o si mu ilana atunṣe rẹ pọ pẹlu awọn ipo atunṣe aṣa.','Define your own statuses before or after Revision Submitted'=>'Ṣalaye awọn ipo tirẹ ṣaaju tabi lẹhin Atunṣe ti a fi silẹ','New predefined statuses: Deferred, Needs Work, Rejected'=>'Awọn ipo ti a ti ṣalaye tẹlẹ: Ti a da duro, Nilo Iṣẹ, Ti kọ','Statuses can be specific to a post type'=>'Awọn ipo le jẹ pato si iru ifiweranṣẹ kan','Control access to statuses per-role'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si awọn ipo ni ibamu si ipa','Status workflow can be nested with sub-statuses'=>'Ilana ipo le ni awọn ipo-kekere','Get PublishPress Statuses Pro'=>'Gba PublishPress Statuses Pro','Learn More'=>'Kọ ẹkọ diẹ sii','Pro Plugin'=>'Pro Plugin','Install Statuses Pro to unlock custom revision statuses.'=>'Fi Statuses Pro sii lati ṣii awọn ipo atunṣe aṣa.','Configure for any post type and role to match your editing workflow.'=>'Ṣeto fun eyikeyi iru ifiweranṣẹ ati ipa lati ba iṣẹ ṣiṣatunkọ rẹ mu.','Get Statuses Pro'=>'Gba Statuses Pro','Maximum revisions per post:'=>'Iye to pọ julọ ti awọn atunṣe fun ifiweranṣẹ:','(unlimited)'=>'(ailewu)','Note that archiving can also be disabled by %1$sPost Type%2$s.'=>'Ṣe akiyesi pe a tun le pa arọwọto rẹ nipasẹ %1$sIru Ifiweranṣẹ%2$s.','%s capability'=>'%s agbara','Assign capability to roles'=>'Fi agbara si awọn ipa','Prevent non-Administrators from restoring a revision without the %s.'=>'Dena awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso lati tun gbe atunṣe kan laisi %s.','Prevent non-Administrators from restoring a revision without the restore_revisions capability'=>'Dena awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso lati tun gbe atunṣe kan laisi agbara restore_revisions','Modification Date'=>'Ọjọ Ayipada','Revision Creation'=>'Ṣiṣẹda Atunṣe','Submission'=>'Ifisilẹ','Scheduling'=>'Iṣeto','Publication'=>'Ikede','Management'=>'Iṣakoso','Create Revision capabilities'=>'Ṣẹda awọn agbara Atunṣe','Assign capabilities to roles'=>'Fi awọn agbara si awọn ipa','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require %s.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣatunkọ ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere %s.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require Create Revision capabilities (copy_posts, copy_others_pages, etc.)'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere awọn agbara Ṣẹda Atunṣe (copy_posts, copy_others_pages, ati bẹbẹ lọ)','To expand the Pages list, assign %s.'=>'Lati fa akojọ Awọn oju-iwe, yan %s.','Listing capabilities'=>'Awọn agbara atokọ','To expand the Pages list, assign Listing capabilities (list_others_pages, list_published_posts, etc.)'=>'Lati fa akojọ Awọn oju-iwe, yan Awọn agbara Atokọ (list_others_pages, list_published_posts, ati bẹbẹ lọ)','This plugin introduces a new user role, "Revisor."'=>'Ẹya yii ṣafihan ipa olumulo tuntun, "Revisor."','Revision by a user who does not have the %s will cause all custom html tags to be stripped out.'=>'Atunṣe nipasẹ olumulo ti ko ni %s yoo fa ki gbogbo awọn aami html adani yọkuro.','Revision by a user who does not have the unfiltered_html capability will cause all custom html tags to be stripped out.'=>'Atunṣe nipasẹ olumulo ti ko ni agbara unfiltered_html yoo fa ki gbogbo awọn aami html adani yọkuro.','Broadest compat including Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder'=>'Ibaraenisepo ti o gbooro julọ pẹlu Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder','Standard storage schema for broadest 3rd party compat'=>'Iṣeto ibi ipamọ boṣewa fun ibaraenisepo 3rd party ti o gbooro julọ','Enhanced Revision access control with PublishPress plugins'=>'Iṣakoso iraye si Atunṣe ti a mu pọ si pẹlu awọn amugbooro PublishPress','In enhanced mode, a Revision\'s status is stored by standard WordPress schema. Some plugins are incompatible.'=>'Ni ipo ti a mu pọ si, ipo Atunṣe ni a fipamọ nipasẹ iṣeto boṣewa WordPress. Diẹ ninu awọn amugbooro ko ni ibamu.','Prevent Revision creation if the post already has another Revision in progress.'=>'Dena ṣẹda Atunṣe ti ifiweranṣẹ naa ba ti ni Atunṣe miiran ni ilana.','Work around cache plugin conflicts by requerying for revisions before suppressing the New Revision link.'=>'Ṣe ayẹwo awọn iṣoro amugbooro kẹkẹ nipa tun beere fun awọn atunṣe ṣaaju ki o to pa ọna asopọ Atunṣe Tuntun.','If the user does not have a regular Edit link, recaption the %s link as "Edit."'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba ni ọna asopọ Ṣatunkọ deede, yi ọna asopọ %s pada si "Ṣatunkọ."','Default labels are "Not Submitted for Approval", "Submitted for Approval", "Scheduled Revision"'=>'Awọn aami aiyipada ni "Ko Ti Fọwọsi Fun Igbasilẹ", "Ti Fọwọsi Fun Igbasilẹ", "Atunṣe Ti a Ṣeto"','Enable published content to be copied, edited, submitted for approval and managed on the %sNew Revisions%s screen.'=>'Muu ki akoonu ti a tẹjade le ṣee daakọ, ṣe atunṣe, fi silẹ fun fọwọsi ati ṣakoso lori iboju %sAtunṣe Tuntun%s.','Submit Revision capabilities'=>'Fi awọn agbara Atunṣe silẹ','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require Submit Revision capabilities (revise_posts, revise_others_pages, etc.)'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere awọn agbara Fi Atunṣe silẹ (revise_posts, revise_others_pages, ati bẹbẹ lọ)','When a %s is published, update post publish date to current time.'=>'Nigba ti a ba tẹjade %s, ṣe imudojuiwọn ọjọ ifiweranṣẹ si akoko lọwọlọwọ.','When a %s is published, update post modified date to current time.'=>'Nigba ti a ba tẹjade %s, ṣe imudojuiwọn ọjọ ti a ṣe atunṣe si akoko lọwọlọwọ.','When a new revision is created by any user who is allowed to submit revisions, automatically submit it.'=>'Nigbati a ba ṣẹda atunṣe tuntun nipasẹ eyikeyi olumulo ti a gba laaye lati fi awọn atunṣe silẹ, fi silẹ laifọwọyi.','Auto-submit revisions if the user can directly edit the main post.'=>'Fi awọn atunṣe silẹ laifọwọyi ti olumulo ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ akọkọ taara.','This allows immediate approval within the Compare screen. If disabled, a Preview link is provided instead.'=>'Eyi n gba ifọwọsi lẹsẹkẹsẹ lori iboju Ifiwera. Ti a ko ba mu ṣiṣẹ, a pese ọna asopọ Awotẹlẹ dipo.','If a currently published post or page is edited and a future date set, the change will not be applied until the selected date.'=>'Ti ifiweranṣẹ tabi oju-iwe ti a tẹjade lọwọlọwọ ba jẹ atunṣe ati ọjọ iwaju ti ṣeto, iyipada naa kii yoo lo titi di ọjọ ti a yan.','Publish scheduled revisions using the WP-Cron mechanism. On some sites, publication will fail if this setting is disabled.'=>'Tẹjade awọn atunṣe ti a ṣeto nipa lilo ilana WP-Cron. Ni diẹ ninu awọn aaye, ifiweranṣẹ yoo kuna ti a ba mu iṣeto yii ṣiṣẹ.','Publish scheduled revisions asynchronously, via a secondary http request from the server.  This is usually best since it eliminates delay, but some servers may not support it.'=>'Tẹjade awọn atunṣe ti a ṣeto ni aijọ, nipasẹ ibeere http keji lati ọdọ olupin. Eyi jẹ nigbagbogbo dara julọ bi o ṣe n yọkuro idaduro, ṣugbọn diẹ ninu awọn olupin le ma ṣe atilẹyin rẹ.','The WP-Cron trigger is disabled, but scheduled tasks are still excecuted using a custom trigger.'=>'Ipe WP-Cron ti wa ni pipade, ṣugbọn awọn iṣẹ ti a ṣeto ṣi wa ni ṣiṣe nipa lilo ipe aṣa kan.','Caption the button as either "Approve and Publish" or "Approve and Schedule."'=>'Fa akọle bọtini bi "Fọwọsi ati Tẹjade" tabi "Fọwọsi ati Ṣeto."','This may improve compatibility with some plugins.'=>'Eyi le mu ibamu pọ si pẹlu diẹ ninu awọn afikun.','Control New Revisions access with the %s.'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si Awọn Atunṣe Tuntun pẹlu %s.','Control New Revisions access with the manage_revision_queue capability.'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si Awọn Atunṣe Tuntun pẹlu agbara manage_revision_queue.','Users will need the %s to edit others\' Unsubmitted Revisions.'=>'Awọn olumulo yoo nilo %s lati ṣe atunṣe Awọn Atunṣe Ti a Ko Fi silẹ ti awọn miiran.','Users will need the manage_unsubmitted_revisions capability to edit others\' Unsubmitted Revisions.'=>'Awọn olumulo yoo nilo agbara manage_unsubmitted_revisions lati ṣe atunṣe Awọn Atunṣe Ti a Ko Fi silẹ ti awọn miiran.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require the %s.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere %s.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require the edit_others_revisions capability.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere agbara edit_others_revisions.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require the list_others_revisions capability.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere agbara list_others_revisions.','Bypass the above restrictions for others\' revisions to logged in user\'s own posts.'=>'Yiyọ awọn ihamọ loke fun awọn atunṣe ti awọn miiran si awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti olumulo ti o forukọsilẹ.','Regenerate "post has revision" flags'=>'Tun ṣe "ifiweranṣẹ ni atunṣe" awọn asia','Apply this maintenance operation if Has Revision labels on Posts / Pages screens mismatch the New Revisions listing.'=>'Loo iṣẹ itọju yii ti awọn afi Has Revision lori awọn iboju Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ / Awọn Oju-iwe ko baamu pẹlu atokọ Awọn Atunṣe Tuntun.','For enhanced notifications, install %sPublishPress Planner%s.'=>'Fun awọn iwifunni ti a ti ni ilọsiwaju, fi sori ẹrọ %sPublishPress Planner%s.','For enhanced notifications, update %sPublishPress Planner%s.'=>'Fun awọn iwifunni ti o ni ilọsiwaju, ṣe imudojuiwọn %sPublishPress Planner%s.','Send revision action notifications using the customizable %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications system%2$s.'=>'Firanṣẹ awọn iwifunni iṣe atunṣe nipa lilo eto %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications%2$s ti a le ṣe adani.','Upgrade to Revisions Pro to send revision action notifications using the customizable %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications system%2$s.'=>'Gba Revisions Pro lati firanṣẹ awọn iwifunni iṣe atunṣe nipa lilo eto %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications%2$s ti a le ṣe adani.','Users matching Planner > Notifications configuration get revision notifications only if they can edit the published post.'=>'Awọn olumulo ti o baamu iṣeto Planner > Notifications gba awọn iwifunni atunṣe nikan ti wọn ba le satunkọ ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade.','Never'=>'Kò sí','By default'=>'Ní aiyé','Always'=>'Ní gbogbo igba','select recipients'=>'yan awọn olugba','To avoid notification failures, buffer emails for delayed sending once minute, hour or day limits are exceeded'=>'Lati yago fun awọn ikuna iwifunni, pa awọn imeeli fun ifiranṣẹ pẹ̀yà lẹ́kan ti a ti kọja awọn aala iṣẹju, wakati tabi ọjọ','Notification Buffer'=>'Iboju Iwifunni','Notification Log'=>'Iwe Iroyin Iwifunni','Purge Notification Buffer'=>'Pa Iboju Iwifunni','Truncate Notification Log'=>'Ge Iwe Iroyin Iwifunni','Sent in last minute: %d / %d'=>'Ti a firanṣẹ ni iṣẹju to kẹhin: %d / %d','Sent in last hour: %d / %d'=>'Ti a firanṣẹ ni wakati to kẹhin: %d / %d','Sent in last day: %d / %d'=>'Ti a firanṣẹ ni ọjọ to kẹhin: %d / %d','Seconds until next buffer processing time: %d'=>'Awọn aaya titi di akoko ilana iboju to nbọ: %d','Show Notification Log / Buffer'=>'Fihan Iwe Iroyin Iwifunni / Iboju','Show with message content'=>'Fihan pẹlu akoonu ifiranṣẹ','Ready to enhance your revision notifications?'=>'Ṣe o ti ṣetan lati mu awọn iwifunni atunṣe rẹ pọ si?','Upgrade to Revisions Pro for integration with our PublishPress Planner Notifications framework.'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn si Revisions Pro fun isopọ pẹlu ilana Ifitonileti PublishPress Planner wa.','Customize notification message and subject'=>'Ṣe akanṣe ifitonileti ifiranṣẹ ati akọle','Notify for a specific post type, category or term'=>'Kilọ fun iru ifiweranṣẹ pato, ẹka tabi ọrọ','Target specific roles, users, or user groups'=>'Fojusi awọn ipa pato, awọn olumulo, tabi awọn ẹgbẹ olumulo','With PublishPress Planner Pro, send notifications to a Slack channel'=>'Pẹlu PublishPress Planner Pro, fi awọn ifitonileti ranṣẹ si ikanni Slack','Pro Feature'=>'Ẹya Pro','Upgrade to Revisions Pro to unlock Planner Notifications integration.'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn si Revisions Pro lati ṣii isopọ Ifitonileti Planner.','Customize notification content and recipients for each notification type.'=>'Ṣe akanṣe akoonu ifitonileti ati awọn olugba fun gbogbo iru ifitonileti.','Some themes may block revision preview.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn akori le dina iworan atunṣe.','Published Post Slug'=>'Slug Ifiweranṣẹ Ti a tẹjade','Revision Slug'=>'Slug Atunṣe','Revision ID only'=>'ID Atunṣe nikan','Some themes or plugins may require Revision Slug or Revision ID link type for proper template loading and field display.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn akori tabi awọn afikun le nilo Slug Atunṣe tabi ID Atunṣe iru ọna asopọ fun ikojọpọ awoṣe to pe ati ifihan aaye.','The revision preview argument is configured by constant definition: %s'=>'Argument iworan atunṣe ti wa ni iṣeto nipasẹ itumọ iduro: %s','Adjust preview links to use "rv_preview" argument instead of "preview". Experiment to see which works best with your theme.'=>'Ṣatunṣe awọn ọna asopọ iworan lati lo "rv_preview" argument dipo "iworan". Ṣe idanwo lati wo eyi ti o ṣiṣẹ dara julọ pẹlu akori rẹ.','Some themes may require this setting for correct revision preview display.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn akori le nilo eto yii fun ifihan iworan atunṣe to pe.','This should usually be enabled, except to work around conflicts with other another plugin\'s postmeta data.'=>'Eyi yẹ ki o maa jẹ ki o ṣiṣẹ, ayafi lati yago fun awọn ija pẹlu data postmeta ti afikun miiran.','If the user can\'t publish, require the %s to edit others\' unpublished Posts.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le tẹjade, beere %s lati ṣatunkọ awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti a ko tẹjade ti awọn miiran.','If the user can\'t publish, require the edit_others_drafts capability to edit others\' unpublished Posts.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le tẹjade, beere agbara edit_others_drafts lati ṣatunkọ awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti a ko tẹjade ti awọn miiran.','If post-specific permissions restrict or expand access to a post, apply those permissions to its revisions also.'=>'Ti awọn aṣẹ aṣẹ pato fun ifiweranṣẹ ba ni ihamọ tabi fa iraye si ifiweranṣẹ, lo awọn aṣẹ wọnyẹn fun awọn atunṣe rẹ paapaa.','Rank Math SEO may prevent Revision update on some sites.'=>'Rank Math SEO le ṣe idiwọ imudojuiwọn Atunwo lori diẹ ninu awọn aaye.','WPML Translation Management'=>'Iṣakoso Itumọ WPML','Sync "Needs Update" flags'=>'Sopọ "Nilo Imudojuiwọn" awọn asia','Set "Needs Update" for any post with translations which was updated (possibly by revision approval) more recently than its translations.'=>'Ṣeto "Nilo Imudojuiwọn" fun eyikeyi ifiweranṣẹ pẹlu awọn itumọ ti a ti imudojuiwọn (o ṣee ṣe nipasẹ ifọwọsi atunwo) laipẹ ju awọn itumọ rẹ lọ.','Show descriptive captions for PublishPress Revisions settings.'=>'Fihan awọn akọle alaye fun awọn eto Atunwo PublishPress.','Plugin settings, New Revisions contents and related data will be deleted, but only after the last copy of Revisions / Revisions Pro is deleted.'=>'Awọn eto afikun, Awọn akoonu Atunwo Tuntun ati data ti o jọmọ yoo parẹ, ṣugbọn nikan lẹhin ti ẹda ikẹhin ti Atunwo / Atunwo Pro ti parẹ.','Unlock Pro Integrations'=>'Ṣii Awọn Isopọ Pro','Upgrade to the Pro version for optimal compatibility and prompt, professional support.'=>'Gbe si ẹya Pro fun ibamu ti o dara julọ ati atilẹyin ọjọgbọn, akoko.','Admin'=>'Alakoso','Builder'=>'Onkọwe','Cache'=>'Kaṣe','E-Commerce'=>'E-Commerce','Fields'=>'Awọn agbegbe','Multilingual'=>'Pupọ ede','SEO'=>'SEO','Workflow'=>'Ilana iṣẹ','Specify which PublishPress Revisions Settings to control network-wide. Unselected settings are controlled separately on each site.'=>'Ṣalaye iru Awọn Eto Atunwo PublishPress lati ṣakoso gbogbo nẹtiwọọki. Awọn eto ti ko yan ni a ṣe iṣakoso lọtọ lori ọkọọkan aaye.','network-wide control of "%s"'=>'iṣakoso gbogbo nẹtiwọọki 